{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":52891,"seasonNumber":3},"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":3,"name":{"value":"Stagione 3","language":"it-IT"},"year":2015,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jnQ9w71shvYjZURbMIvZ62DIf7A.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1188639","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuru Yuri's protagonist Akaza Akari here!! Yuri Yuri has returned to TV! Since summer vacation is over and school is starting, I hope to have lots of fun with the members of the Amusement Club! Now let's head to the club room!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sd7nu9R2AnykDdChDEpwEqYtMdw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sd7nu9R2AnykDdChDEpwEqYtMdw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/1"},{"id":"1188640","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"S-Sugiura Ayano here! No one told me it was my turn to do this! I'm glad to be back here with everyone. I-I didn't come back here for you! But thanks for waiting! Huh? My mom's calling me. What could it be...?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7S7vgiurrIrTXTPU6kJ9YQeWoqw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7S7vgiurrIrTXTPU6kJ9YQeWoqw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/2"},{"id":"1188641","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tada! Omuro Sakurako-sama has arrived! Has everyone been doing well? I'm always full of energy! Come to think of it, the other day I studied with Himawari. I think Himawari's... uh... b-breasts might have gotten bigger again... Argh! She even lectured me, too. Okay, I've got a good idea!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AltFaFCgNhfp7PlixacaIl3JNJB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AltFaFCgNhfp7PlixacaIl3JNJB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/3"},{"id":"1188642","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hello, everyone. This is Akari's sister Akaza Akane. Thank you for looking after Akari. Akari's so cute. She's always such an angel. She's the apple of my eye. I could do this to Akari's that, and... Oh, excuse me. My friends are coming over today. I must get ready.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/auj5753cz9IokcgeD3e8VpGBy8B.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/auj5753cz9IokcgeD3e8VpGBy8B.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/4"},{"id":"1188644","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ikeda Chitose here. I'm glad to see everyone again. Also, Ayano-chan and Toshino-san have already shown me so much already... It's great fodder for my fantasies. Oh, no. My nose is bleeding... No, wait. Today I have plans to go out with Ayano-chan! I'm so excited!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uArycqgG0NpnfuziLvaI6pwAF0K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uArycqgG0NpnfuziLvaI6pwAF0K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/5"},{"id":"1188645","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yoshikawa Chinatsu here. Seeing Yui-senpai doing this and that, I'm just... overjoyed! I suppose I can let the rest of you take a peek as well! I've invited Yui-senpai to my house again today. I'd better dress myself up!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4amrSNNXwMZtLAKJDjlZ8YR7Sgb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4amrSNNXwMZtLAKJDjlZ8YR7Sgb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/6"},{"id":"1188647","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ha ha ha! Yuru Yuri's true protagonist Toshino Kyoko here! I know I'm a bit late, but did everyone wait like good girls and boys? The Amusement Club is off to defeat new enemies, so come along! What? That's not in the script? Too bad.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A0sdrkzZO7k9tLRABdIgf8Jp8s0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A0sdrkzZO7k9tLRABdIgf8Jp8s0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/7"},{"id":"1188648","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Student council president Matsumoto Rise here. I'm glad to see all of you. Since I apparently have a turn as well, I'd appreciate your continued support. Come to think of it, Nishigaki-sensei has a new colleague. I hope you'll enjoy it.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m7sUlkLwRkmF17tECPpHauBTNtB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m7sUlkLwRkmF17tECPpHauBTNtB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/8"},{"id":"1188649","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ikeda Chizuru here. I guess I'm gratefull to see you again. Tsk! Anyway, she had to get involved and make things complicated again... Sheesh. I'm not mad because I want to be, but... Sometimes I wish I could smile like my sister.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nBu5gcjYPfCEjPdPLLB21CGWszp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nBu5gcjYPfCEjPdPLLB21CGWszp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/9"},{"id":"1188650","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Funami Yui here. I'm glad to see you all again. Kyoko still isn't doing her homework and still causes trouble by bringing weird things to school... But with Akari, Chinatsu-chan, and even Kyoko around, nothing really serious happens, but I do have fun.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-12-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xwO9rcwSRiJYGCwVj4HEcZynp4s.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xwO9rcwSRiJYGCwVj4HEcZynp4s.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/10"},{"id":"1188651","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Good to see you again, everyone. Furutani Himawari here. I thought we'd finally get to be together again, but time flies, doesn't it? And... it seems Sakurako is causing more trouble. I need to look after her...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-12-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xcemoRhFoXDjiCNkOM1qFkAa8xU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xcemoRhFoXDjiCNkOM1qFkAa8xU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/11"},{"id":"1188653","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuru Yuri's protagonist Akaza Akari here!! This is the final episode of Yuru Yuri San Hai!. But if you want to see us again, you probably will! Now let's head to the club room!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1HpsZbbc9U4ZIgzcl8mviuGPA7y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1HpsZbbc9U4ZIgzcl8mviuGPA7y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/52891/season/3"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793450403765,"status":"